      "translations": {
        "en": "So when the argument was completed upon them, Allah sent Jibraeel (peace be upon him), Mikaeel (peace be upon him), and Israfeel (peace be upon him) in the form of boys wearing gowns. So they passed by Lut (peace be upon him) while he was farming. He said, 'Where are you intending to go? I have not seen anyone more good-looking than you.' They said, 'Our Master has sent us to the Lord of this city.'"
