      "translations": {
        "en": "He said: So they sat. He said: So he sent for his daughter, saying, 'Come to them with bread, and come to them with water in the gourd, and come to them with a cloak to cover themselves with from the cold.' So when the daughter went, the rain and the valley faced them. So Lut (peace be upon him) said, 'This is the time the valley goes with the young boys. Arise until we pass by.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
