      "translations": {
        "en": "And Lut (peace be upon him) went on walking in the base of the wall, while Jibraeel (peace be upon him), Mikaeel (peace be upon him), and Israfeel (peace be upon him) were walking in the middle of the road. So he said, 'O my sons, walk over here.' They said, 'Our Master has commanded us to walk in the middle of it.' And Lut (peace be upon him) was trying to benefit from the darkness."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
