      "translations": {
        "en": "And Iblees passed by and seized a child from the lap of a woman and dropped him in the well. So the people of the city gathered, all of them at the door of Lut (peace be upon him). So when they looked at the boys in the house of Lut (peace be upon him), they said, 'O Lut (peace be upon him)! You have entered into our deeds.'"
      }
