    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَقَالَ هَؤُلَاءِ ضَيْفِي فَلَا تَفْضَحُونِي فِي ضَيْفِي قَالُوا هُمْ ثَلَاثَةٌ خُذْ وَاحِداً وَ أَعْطِنَا اثْنَيْنِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He said, 'These are my guests, so do not disgrace me regarding my guests.' They said, 'They are three of them, so take one and give us two.'"
      }
