      "translations": {
        "en": "So he took a handful of soil from Bataha and struck their faces with it, and said, 'The faces be ugly!' So the people of the city became blind, all of them. And Lut (peace be upon him) said to them, 'O Messengers of my Lord! So what did my Lord command you with regarding them?' They said, 'He commanded us that we should seize them at dawn.'"
